    description:
      "# Monorepo Setup & Core Infrastructure\n\n> Target: `jarod-rosenthal/oncallshift` (GitHub)\n> Live URL: [https://oncallshift.com](https://oncallshift.com)\n> Dependencies: None — first ticket.\n\n## What This Ticket Delivers\n\nA production-ready monorepo with Express backend, React frontend, React Native mobile app, Docker containerization, and Terraform infrastructure. This ticket creates the **project skeleton and infrastructure** — domain models and business logic come in subsequent tickets.\n\n1. Monorepo structure with `backend/`, `frontend/`, `mobile/`, `infrastructure/`, `e2e/`, `packages/`\n2. Express + TypeScript backend with TypeORM, health endpoints, and middleware\n3. React 19 + Vite frontend with TailwindCSS and authentication shell\n4. Docker multi-stage build with frontend integration\n5. `bin/dev` script for local development with hot reload\n6. GitHub Actions CI/CD pipelines\n7. `CLAUDE.md` development guide for AI workers\n\n## Tech Stack\n\n| Layer | Technology |\n| -- | -- |\n| Backend | Express 4 + TypeScript + TypeORM + PostgreSQL |\n| Frontend | React 19 + Vite + TailwindCSS + React Router |\n| Mobile | React Native + Expo |\n| Infrastructure | Terraform + AWS (ECS, RDS, ALB, CloudFront) |\n| Auth | AWS Cognito |\n| Queues | AWS SQS |\n| Email | AWS SES |\n\n## Work Groups\n\n### Group 1: Monorepo scaffolding (4 files)\n```\npackage.json          # Root workspace config\nDockerfile            # Multi-stage production build\ndocker-compose.yml    # Local dev (Postgres, Redis)\nbin/dev               # Development startup script\n```\n\n### Group 2: Backend scaffolding (8 files)\n```\nbackend/src/index.ts           # Express app entry\nbackend/src/api/health.ts      # Health check endpoint\nbackend/src/shared/db/         # TypeORM connection config\nbackend/src/shared/auth/       # JWT middleware stub\nbackend/tsconfig.json\nbackend/package.json\n```\n\n### Group 3: Frontend scaffolding (6 files)\n```\nfrontend/src/App.tsx           # React Router shell\nfrontend/src/pages/Landing.tsx # Public landing page\nfrontend/src/pages/Login.tsx   # Auth form\nfrontend/vite.config.ts\nfrontend/tailwind.config.ts\nfrontend/package.json\n```\n\n### Group 4: Terraform infrastructure (5 files)\n```\ninfrastructure/terraform/environments/dev/main.tf\ninfrastructure/terraform/modules/database/\ninfrastructure/terraform/modules/ecs-service/\ninfrastructure/terraform/modules/networking/\n```\n\n### Group 5: Documentation & CI/CD (3 files)\n```\nCLAUDE.md\nREADME.md\n.github/workflows/ci.yml\n```\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n\n- [ ] `bin/dev` starts backend, frontend, and Postgres locally\n- [ ] `GET /api/health` returns 200\n- [ ] Frontend loads on port 5173 with login page\n- [ ] Docker build succeeds\n- [ ] Terraform plan succeeds\n- [ ] CI pipeline passes\n- [ ] CLAUDE.md written for future AI workers",
