      "# Code Quality & Refactoring Sprint\n\n> Dependencies: OCS-12 (production deploy)\n\n## What This Ticket Delivers\n\nPost-launch code quality improvements: type safety, memory leak fixes, component refactoring, validation middleware, N+1 query elimination, and security hardening.\n\n## Refactoring Tasks\n\n### Backend\n- OCS-789: Refactor `schedules.ts` (148KB) into service modules\n- OCS-792: Add TypeScript interfaces to `ai-config.ts` route\n- OCS-794: Shared validation error middleware for all routes\n- OCS-799: Batch schedule queries in escalation timer (N+1 fix)\n- OCS-787: Re-enable Jira webhook HMAC signature verification\n- OCS-819: Add Jira webhook signature verification tests\n- Refactor console.log in deployment scripts\n- Refactor API clients to remove duplicated code\n- Remediate hardcoded secret in Terraform\n- Scope IAM policies to minimum required permissions\n\n### Frontend\n- OCS-783: Extract shared color utility across mobile screens\n- OCS-786: Decompose incident detail into sub-components\n- OCS-802: Fix memory leaks in remaining pages\n- OCS-824: Sanitize web frontend components\n- OCS-824: Multi-provider AI implementation\n\n## Quality Metrics\n\n- TypeScript strict mode: 0 errors\n- ESLint: 0 warnings\n- Memory leaks: 0 (verified with heap snapshots)\n- N+1 queries: 0 (verified with query logging)",
